	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium\">&nbsp;Le respect de l\'image de marque d\'Air Inter, d\'Air Inter Virtual Airline et de l\'ARIT.</span></span></li>
