<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong>1.1</strong> -&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">All contact with Air Inter Virtual Airlines is made through the website <strong><a class=\"decorated-link\" data-end=\"570\" data-start=\"544\" href=\"http://www.airinter-va.org\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_new\"><span style=\"color:#0000cc;\">http://www.airinter-va.org<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ms-0.5 inline-block align-middle leading-none\"></span></span></a></strong>&nbsp;via the “Contact us” section or by email : <span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\"><strong><a href=\"mailto:it001alex@airinter-va.org?subject=ITVA\"><span style=\"color:#0000cc;\">it001alex@airinter-va.org</span></a></strong></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\"><strong><a href=\"mailto:it001alex@airinter-va.org?subject=ITVA\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"></span></a></strong><br />
